<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Compaq EPS upped-PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Compaq EPS upped-PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc analyst Walter Winnitzki said that he raised his 1997 and 1998 earnings estimates and price target on Compaq Computer Corp, after its solid second quarter and unveiling of its new manufacturing and distribution model.</p>
<p>-- Winnitzki said he raised his 1997 estimate to $6.50 from $6.15 and 1998 estimate to $7.65 from $7.25.</p>
<p>-- He also said he raised his price target on Compaq to $150-$155, based on 20 times his new 1998 estimate.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Compaq remains our favorite investment vehicle in the PC hardware sector,&quot; Winnitzki said in a note to clients.</p>
</text>
